Home / About
Built to see what’s next.
Built in Japan. Connected to the world. Our concept is simple: back exceptional people at the earliest stages and help ambitious ideas grow beyond borders.
01 — OUR BELIEF
Start before the starting line.
Progress requires the willingness to believe before the path is obvious.
02 — OUR APPROACH
Be curious before consensus.
We look for original thinking, resilient teams, and technology that can reshape industries.
03 — OUR NETWORK
Connect Japan and the U.S.
A cross-border perspective helps discoveries reach new partners, customers, and markets.
04 — LONG-TERM VIEW
Build something that lasts.
We care about the foundations for lasting growth, not only the next milestone.
